# Morrowind Temple: "Pilgrimages of the Seven Graces" (TT_SevenGraces), which Tuls Valen asks for before any duty.
# He hands over "The Pilgrim's Path" ("Seven Graces": 10). At each shrine the pilgrim donates and asks a blessing
# (the shrine's MessageBox "Yes", then the Grace's text): mucksponge at the Fields of Kummu (TT_FieldsKummu 100), a
# soul gem at Ghostgate (TT_Ghostgate), a cure disease potion at the Gnisis Temple (TT_MaskVivec), Dreugh wax in
# Koal Cave (TT_RuddyMan), 100 gold at Vivec's palace (TT_PalaceVivec), a rising force potion at the Stopped Moon
# (TT_StopMoon). In the Puzzle Canal the unarmed Dremora takes a silver longsword ("silver longsword": "Yes, take it."
# 1: TT_PuzzleCanal 50) and the shrine completes the Grace of Courtesy (100). Back in Ald'ruhn, templeStewards sets
# Tuls Valen's completedGraces on the cell change, and he closes the pilgrimage (100).
# Position and PositionCell stand in for the travel, AddItem for buying or gathering the donations.
# Ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05: 05932999 Kummu, 05D4ABE2 Ghostgate, 054A292D Gnisis, 05854536 Koal Cave,
# 0549E254 the palace, 058EF2FE the Stopped Moon, 05E0A126 the Puzzle Canal.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_join --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_sevengraces_start
talk tuls valen
ask duties
ask Seven Graces
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SevenGraces == 10
expect player->GetItemCount "bk_PilgrimsPath" == 1
bye
run
player->AddItem "Ingred_Muck_01" 10
player->AddItem "Misc_soulgem_petty" 1
player->AddItem "P_Cure_Common_S" 1
player->AddItem "Ingred_Dreugh_Wax_01" 1
player->AddItem "P_Levitation_S" 1
player->AddItem "silver longsword" 1
player->AddItem "Gold_001" 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_kummu
run
player->Position 14594 -33550 800 0
wait 300
activate 05932999
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_FieldsKummu == 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_ghostgate
run
player->Position 24438 45150 4600 0
wait 300
activate 05D4ABE2
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_Ghostgate == 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_gnisis
run
player->PositionCell 899 2800 372 0 "Gnisis, Temple"
wait 150
activate 054A292D
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_MaskVivec == 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_koal
run
player->PositionCell 2956 880 212 0 "Koal Cave"
wait 150
activate 05854536
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_RuddyMan == 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_palace
run
player->Position 33096 -106560 2000 0
wait 300
activate 0549E254
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_PalaceVivec == 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_stopmoon
run
player->Position 31856 -102140 1120 0
wait 300
activate 058EF2FE
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_StopMoon == 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_puzzle
run
player->PositionCell 5389 7580 848 0 "Vivec, Puzzle Canal, Center"
until 600 "dremora_ttpc"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk dremora_ttpc
ask silver longsword
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TT_PuzzleCanal == 50
bye
activate 05E0A126
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_PuzzleCanal == 100
end

case tt_sevengraces_done
run
player->PositionCell 3637 3900 14723 0 "Ald-ruhn, Temple"
until 600 "tuls valen"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tuls valen
ask Seven Graces
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SevenGraces == 100
bye
end
